---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy Notice">
  <section class="policy-head"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Families & players</p><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p>How information sent through the academy enquiry form is used.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><article class="container policy-copy"><p class="lead">This form is intended for a parent or guardian to contact Eruditeballersafrica Football Academy about a young player.</p><h2>Information collected</h2><p>The form asks for a player’s name, pathway of interest, academic level, playing position, and a parent or guardian’s name and phone number. You may also share a short message. Do not include medical details in the form.</p><h2>How it is used</h2><p>Academy staff use the information to respond to the enquiry and discuss the relevant pathway. Application records are stored in the academy’s Supabase project and are available only to authenticated staff accounts.</p><h2>Retention and questions</h2><p>The academy must set and publish a retention period and contact route before accepting real applications. Until these details are confirmed, families can contact the academy through their existing academy representative to ask questions about their information.</p><div class="notice"><p><strong>Launch note:</strong> The academy must confirm its data controller/contact details and retention period before this notice is used for live applications.</p></div></article></section>
  <style>.policy-head{background:var(--navy);color:white;padding:5rem 0}.policy-head .eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}.policy-head h1{font-size:clamp(3.6rem,8vw,6rem)}.policy-head p:last-child{color:#d6dfeb}.policy-copy{max-width:800px}.policy-copy h2{font-size:2.1rem;margin:2.5rem 0 .8rem}.policy-copy .lead{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--ink)}.policy-copy .notice{margin-top:2rem}</style>
</SiteLayout>
